    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Source and scope :-",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#000000"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " Data comes from ClinicalTrials.gov via the AACT flat files (snapshot: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "[date]",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "). The analysis covers interventional studies with a start year of 1990–2025 whose status is Completed or Terminated. Ongoing, withdrawn and unknown-status trials are excluded.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Definitions :-",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#000000"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Finished trial:",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " completed or terminated. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Termination rate:",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " terminated trials ÷ finished trials. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Stopped per 100:",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " terminated trials per 100 finished trials in the full selection.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Stop-reason classification :-",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#000000"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " Sponsors enter stop reasons as free text. I grouped them into categories with keyword-matching rules, and each trial gets one category. Wording that matches no rule falls under “Other”. Treat the categories as indicative, not exact.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Reading the numbers :-",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#000000"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " Recent start years are incomplete because only already-finished trials are counted, so recent termination rates and year-over-year changes are understated. Rates are hidden or flagged where fewer than 30 finished trials exist. Enrollment uses the median because 164 mega-trials (over 100,000 participants) skew the mean (median 50 vs mean 458).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Phase :-",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#000000"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " “Not Applicable” covers behavioural, device and procedural studies, which have no phase. They are 49% of finished trials and stop less often (6.7%) than Phase 1–4 drug trials (13.8%), so do not compare them directly.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Counting :-",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "color": "#000000"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " A trial can have several conditions, countries or intervention types and appears under each, so rows overlap. Totals show unique trials.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
